WEBVTT

00:01:30.550 --> 00:01:31.530
Ryner.

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:40.660
You couldn't be!

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:47.080
Too slow.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:23.330
Welcome back, Ryner.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:28.540
I couldn't allow such an arbitrary act under my watch.

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:31.030
I figured you'd come.

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:36.300
It has been a long time, Duke Lieral Lieutolu.

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:41.760
Truly. You've grown quite a bit, Lucile Eris.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:46.280
He has not yet reached the point where it's safe for him to view the door.

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:52.020
It's not something for you to decide.

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:55.690
I suppose that makes you an obstacle, then.

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:58.880
What do you think this is?

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:03.200
A hero relic? Such things cannot kill me.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.240
I know. But...

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:13.420
Smash it all, Sipuamus.

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:31.270
I'll have to find a curse just for killing you before the next time we meet.

00:03:42.390 --> 00:03:43.820
Lucile?

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:46.120
It's over now.

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:48.380
And Duke Lieutolu?

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:49.820
He managed to escape.

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:54.370
That's not like you. Have you lost your edge?

00:03:56.470 --> 00:04:00.500
Saying such things has become practically second nature to you, hasn't it?

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:03.760
Duke Lieral Lieutolu,

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:06.860
the ghost who escapes death and haunts Roland.

00:04:06.860 --> 00:04:10.180
Seek him out... and kill him.

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:12.160
I see.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:17.430
It seems as though the world has taken drastic turns while I remained unaware.

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:21.900
You are the ideal king I have desired.

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:23.990
Let all be as Your Majesty commands.

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:44.240
This is what I wanted.

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:48.140
To save this corrupted world...

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:51.050
I called you here today for one simple reason.

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:55.060
I wish to hear your feelings.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:59.560
If I don't like one of your answers, I'll kill you.

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:05.280
Very well. I'll play along. Ask what you will, Lucile Eris.

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:10.790
I thought you would. Come with me.

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:22.460
<i>I can no longer stop on my path.</i>

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:36.930
<i>It doesn't matter who stand before me. I'll kill them all.</i>

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:42.190
<i>For that, I would accept anything.</i>

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:47.760
<i>Even a devil.</i>

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:52.820
So long...

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:56.580
I've waited so long for this moment.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:59.340
Now, become my master.

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:03.280
Cast it all aside. Offer everything as a sacrifice.

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:05.800
Become the master of my sword.

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:09.610
You are the one who will consume this world and rip it open!

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:10.940
A hero.

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:19.870
Now then, let's save this world, shall we?

00:06:19.870 --> 00:06:21.330
I won't allow it.

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:25.140
I won't let you have your way.

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:32.530
I won't let you have your way.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.540
What can an impostor on the verge of disappearance do?

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:39.530
Lies! You're the impostor!

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:41.370
It's you.

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:44.790
Either way, you will lose.

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:50.720
I doubt that fool would die easily...

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:56.640
Hey, hold it.

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:04.400
A beautiful lady calls out to me? I truly am lucky today.

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:11.820
You, what did you do to Ryner?

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:14.740
Answer me!

00:07:15.820 --> 00:07:18.350
Do you care for Ryner?

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:21.750
You do care for him.

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:22.710
Be silent.

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:26.960
Good for you, Ryner. She cares for you.

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:31.210
You're not bad at all.

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:34.930
I'd like to see you get more serious.

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:40.060
I don't know what you're after. But underestimating me leads to death.

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:41.410
Oh? For whom?

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:43.350
For you, of course!

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:53.610
I'd say it's roughly three times as heavy now.

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:57.860
Your chances of winning are nonexistent.

00:07:59.390 --> 00:08:03.950
Oh, yes. You asked what I did to Ryner.

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:04.830
I killed him.

00:08:05.490 --> 00:08:08.000
I stabbed him in the chest with a knife and killed him.

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:12.090
He spat up blood with a pathetic expression.

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:13.110
You lie.

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:18.540
No, it's not a lie. Ryner is dead. Can't you tell for yourself?

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:28.480
Oh, dear. I made you cry.

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:31.230
I'll kill you!

00:08:31.230 --> 00:08:32.480
You couldn't do it.

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:35.440
You! I'll kill you!

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:48.210
You pass.

00:08:48.850 --> 00:08:50.540
Sorry for the trick.

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:57.970
If you care for Ryner that deeply, then...

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:24.120
What is this place?

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:26.530
The Alpha is destruction.

00:09:26.530 --> 00:09:30.980
I bring forth nothing. I bless nothing. I save nothing.

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:33.630
I just erase, completely.

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:39.190
How long have I awaited this day?

00:09:56.340 --> 00:10:00.440
To think that such an imitation could seek to seal me.

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:02.970
But that is over now.

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:06.140
If I consume you, this seal will come undone.

00:10:06.140 --> 00:10:09.830
I go to Alpha. Everything will go according to the contract.

00:10:10.320 --> 00:10:14.090
Begone, Solver of All Formulas!

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:21.510
A human experiment?!

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:27.770
Yes. There are reports that he fled the experiment facility while out of control.

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:32.020
The taboo breaker has been bestowed with forbidden magic,

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:34.520
which has given him extraordinary capabilities, they say.

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:38.800
Kill... Kill...

00:10:41.210 --> 00:10:46.780
But weren't human experiments banned when Lord Astal ascended the throne?

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:52.040
I am the captain of the Roland Empire Taboo Breaker Pursuit Squadron,

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:53.770
Lieutenant Milk Callaud!

00:10:53.770 --> 00:10:56.920
You acquired Roland magic, yet fled...

00:10:57.920 --> 00:10:59.170
Kill!

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:08.850
Please, listen to...

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:12.280
We have orders to eliminate this taboo breaker.

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.520
Does His Majesty know the truth about this?

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:37.090
Yes. The human experiment was carried out at His Majesty's instruction.

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:42.490
Is His Majesty sane?

00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:45.240
Yes. He is very much in control of himself.

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:48.470
He just resumed these experiments because it was necessary.

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:53.100
You all knew about this, didn't you?

00:11:55.170 --> 00:12:00.440
So this is what you've all been hiding from me all this time.

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:02.240
Roland's darkness.

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:06.490
If I...

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:08.810
...die peacefully...

00:12:10.490 --> 00:12:12.660
...can I be at peace?

00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:17.810
If...

00:12:17.810 --> 00:12:20.260
If you make it to adulthood without dying...

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:22.420
...would you marry me?

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:29.320
If you survive, would you join me and...

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:30.880
It's time. Come.

00:12:35.050 --> 00:12:40.470
I guess you're right. There's no point in making a stupid promise.

00:12:40.470 --> 00:12:43.260
After all, I'll just die, anyway...

00:12:43.260 --> 00:12:44.260
Hey.

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:48.780
You cry too much. Don't say you'll die.

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:55.400
You can make it. You're tough. Me, too. I don't plan on dying.

00:12:56.980 --> 00:12:57.920
Ryner...

00:13:01.310 --> 00:13:04.120
So... You don't die, either.

00:13:04.940 --> 00:13:06.090
Right!

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:09.470
I'm sorry.

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:13.370
I'm sorry I couldn't save you.

00:13:14.740 --> 00:13:18.190
I'm sorry this is all I can do.

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:28.230
<i>Even if everything about to happen is what His Majesty plans...</i>

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:31.240
<i>Ryner...</i>

00:13:31.770 --> 00:13:36.110
<i>I'll protect the country where you live.</i>

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:48.680
Damn you, an Artfahle?

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:52.180
Such a paltry curse, guarding against me?

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:00.460
Is it dead?

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:01.970
Hurry, Ryner.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:16.560
Who are you?

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:26.160
You... You've grown so big...

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:30.800
Lieral, you gave me time, didn't you?

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:32.610
I've been waiting so long.

00:14:33.340 --> 00:14:36.560
So long, just to meet you.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:38.850
To meet me?

00:14:39.180 --> 00:14:42.390
I love you, Ryner.

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:50.910
Hurry.

00:14:53.570 --> 00:14:57.480
Get inside, before the Weaver of All Formulas shows up.

00:14:57.480 --> 00:14:59.160
And you'll touch the door.

00:14:59.160 --> 00:14:59.750
The door?

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:05.000
To protect that which you hold dear.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:09.840
You lowly sacrifice, how dare you? How dare you, how dare you, how dare you?!

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:18.840
I wanted to feel you more. To tell how much I love you more.

00:15:18.840 --> 00:15:22.990
I wanted to always be at your side, to see how you grew.

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:39.120
Damn it! Son of a bitch! What the hell am I supposed to do?!

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:44.620
I will not allow it! You shall become my sacrifice right here!

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:12.740
Help... me...

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:18.560
I... you...

00:16:19.440 --> 00:16:21.720
I want...

00:16:21.720 --> 00:16:22.990
...to consume you.

00:16:32.340 --> 00:16:35.350
Huh? What am I doing here?

00:16:35.350 --> 00:16:38.360
I remember some weird guy suddenly stabbing me.

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:45.190
Where am I?

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:48.310
G-Good morning.

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:55.370
Uhm...

00:16:57.060 --> 00:17:00.070
Damn you, Ryner!

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:06.190
You can't save Ryner when you keep running.

00:17:06.190 --> 00:17:08.520
You're the one who keeps running!

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:13.090
You used saving the world as an excuse, and sold Ryner out!

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:14.400
Be silent.

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:17.390
You be silent! I'm not like you.

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:19.460
I won't give up on Ryner!

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:22.440
Speak not of empty dreams.

00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:27.860
You run from choices, from fear, from pain. You cannot save Ryner.

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:32.350
I made a choice, to advance forward.

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:33.480
I'll never allow it!

00:17:33.480 --> 00:17:36.720
Then save Ryner from the darkness!

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:38.520
You can't do it, anyway!

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:42.160
If you could, I would have done it long ago!

00:17:46.180 --> 00:17:48.540
Even so, I'll save Ryner.

00:17:50.810 --> 00:17:51.750
Can you?

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:53.090
I can.

00:17:53.950 --> 00:17:58.590
I'll kill Ryner. I'll save him before he plunges into darkness.

00:17:59.420 --> 00:18:02.590
You can just sleep.

00:18:03.860 --> 00:18:06.260
I'll bring it all to an end.

00:18:25.090 --> 00:18:28.310
Well? Which side won out?

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:34.330
You must have decided what to do about Ryner.

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:51.940
I see, so you don't remember what happened, either.

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:56.820
Yeah, though I feel like I was told something important.

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:02.120
What could it be?

00:19:09.400 --> 00:19:10.740
What's this?

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:55.260
What is the Solver of All Formulas?

00:20:56.350 --> 00:21:00.120
Oh, so you did some research into that?

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:03.030
You're superior, all right. No wonder I set my sights on you.

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:10.040
You must know what's going on in Roland right now, what it truly means.

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:13.880
Is it for Ryner Lute's sake that you act so desperately?

00:21:17.560 --> 00:21:20.590
The hero who fought continually to save the world

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:23.090
sought broken power, and was sealed away.

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:30.220
And to break that seal, he consumed the power of the Lonesome Devil.

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:32.580
Lonesome Devil?

00:21:44.520 --> 00:21:45.400
Why?

00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:49.320
Gastark will launch an invasion into the central continent soon.

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:53.270
We'll probably wind up running straight up against Roland.

00:21:53.270 --> 00:21:57.110
I want to save Ryner before that happens.

00:21:57.110 --> 00:22:00.500
Before Sion Astal betrays Ryner.

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:03.710
How could... Why would Sion do that to Ryner?

00:22:04.100 --> 00:22:09.630
To save the world, the Fallen Black Hero will consume the Lonesome Devil.

00:22:11.910 --> 00:22:16.690
Before Ryner Lute gets consumed by despair more horrible than death itself...

00:22:16.690 --> 00:22:18.570
...you should save him.

00:22:18.570 --> 00:22:20.310
From the Fallen Black Hero.

00:22:24.320 --> 00:22:29.170
Bring Ryner back with you. Make sure to come back to me.

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:40.880
Unrequited love is pretty harsh.

00:22:41.600 --> 00:22:44.830
Your Majesty. All of the preparations are in order.

00:22:44.830 --> 00:22:45.790
All right.

00:22:46.940 --> 00:22:48.460
The time has come!

00:22:49.790 --> 00:22:52.380
We shall advance into the future!

00:22:52.380 --> 00:22:56.890
To realize the dream of a world where no one cries!

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:07.440
Let's go!

00:23:17.510 --> 00:23:19.100
Ryner...

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:32.310
<i>Sion...</i>

00:23:33.670 --> 00:23:34.790
<i>Thank you.</i>
